    "status": "accepted_selected_clips",
    "notes": "H3 video, first takes. The attack skips the green-ringed and flaring lens frames 31-33, the rejected plates and the spark at 41, snapping from the wind-up into the lunge at 43. The death skips the lens flare streaks while kneeling and the green-fringed fall 80-82. The ranged lens brightens as it sights, which reads as the shot. The first walk cycle blows the staff lens out to a flat white disc (13-21); the walk uses the second cycle 62-122, which loops on itself. Re-matted 2026-10-14 with the green-plate spill limit: the green rims on thin and blurred edges are gone, with the same frames, timing, anchor and scale."
